  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Prevention of Gender Based Violence in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen violence prevention mechanisms for women, girls and boys in Rwanda by scaling up promising practices in violence prevention. This will contribute to tackling the social norms which lie behind violence against women and children. This contributes towards our MDGs by promoting gender equality and the empowerment of women, contributing to a reduction  in violence against women, girls and boys.</narrative>
  </description>
